    - target: {fileID: 9154946001312572491, guid: 9a739f3767a46194cbdd0c95311ad6b0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[1]'
      value: Unos orcos la invadieron y no dejan avanzar...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 9154946001312572491, guid: 9a739f3767a46194cbdd0c95311ad6b0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[2]'
      value: 'Tengo la llave de la puerta... '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 9154946001312572491, guid: 9a739f3767a46194cbdd0c95311ad6b0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[3]'
      value: Traeme 3 esqueletos de orco y te doy la llave.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 9154946001312572491, guid: 9a739f3767a46194cbdd0c95311ad6b0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[0].lines.Array.size
